# openvpn_client executes two PowerShell scripts that are MATERIALIZED into files/ from this
# framework's own scripts/ directory, where each source sits beside its Pester spec; the consumer
# runs scripts/materialize-role-scripts.sh inside its framework checkout before the role runs.
# Only the build markers naming those sources are tracked here; the materialized .ps1 copies are
# build artifacts and are deliberately NOT allowlisted, so a stale or hand-edited copy can never
# be committed.
!/applications/openvpn_client/files/Set-DnsNamespaceForwarder.ps1.stub
!/applications/openvpn_client/files/Set-FileAcl.ps1.stub

